eftover config.xml backup copies in /conf and possibly-uncollected tcpdump diagnostic logs.","limitations":["It is unclear from the after-executor temporary-files snapshot whether the /tmp/tcp80.log and /tmp/pflog.log tcpdump diagnostic files on node1 were cleaned up or simply omitted from the bounded snapshot enumeration.","Only node2 and node1-self were available as 'other source' probes for the refusal requirement; no broader set of external addresses could be tested given the topology.","Restart evidence for node3 relies on a functional recovery test from node2/node3 rather than a distinct node3-side health check beyond boot-identity and connectivity, since node3 has no managed service of its own."]},"ttft_ms":41044,"type":"result","duration_ms":82262,"uuid":"1c78b682-83d9-4c13-b2d2-331ed0c7f03d","ttft_stream_ms":1450,"time_to_request_ms":46,"first_content_frame_ms":1641,"queued_turn_count":0}
